Implementing a multi-tree list (also known as a hierarchical tree view) in an Angular application involves several steps. Below is a basic implementation guide:

### Step 1: Set Up Your Project

First, make sure you have Node.js and npm installed on your machine.

Create a new Angular project:
```bash
ng new my-app
cd my-app
```

Install the necessary dependencies for managing JSON data:
```bash
